{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_37","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'PlayerMana\\\\.Reset|reset behavior|debug spend|DebugMana|fill Image|empty|zero mana' Pipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/reviews/*.json Pipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/synthesis.json\"","aggregated_output":"Pipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/synthesis.json:15:      \"Replace manually asserted ordinary-task evidence with typed gate manifests derived from actual Git/Unity runners. Evidence may not be empty; manifests must identify the runner, command, exact integration ref/commit, XML or human evidence, and reviewed dependency surfaces.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/synthesis.json:26:      \"Current evidence records can structurally contain empty conformance surfaces or passing gates with empty evidence; they also evaluate HEAD rather than proving integration into a protected branch such as main.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/synthesis.json:32:    \"decision_rationale\": \"This conclusion rests on primary behavior, not reviewer frequency. At frozen clean HEAD 9f2485dca1b61360e6d02810adc71e021346496e, TaskGraph reports 37 valid contracts and 59 dependency edges but readiness is unavailable and zero tasks are authorized; NSC-003 and NSC-005 are not delivered, while NSC-023 is conformant. GDDRAG reports 41 current, integrity-valid chunks. Nevertheless, the GDD and its current RAG call the deleted nested DoorPrototype scene canonical; Git contains only Assets/Scenes/DoorPrototype.unity, 13 tasks still lock the deleted scene, 16 tasks mention it, and NSC-037 explicitly rejects the real authoritative scene. Structural validation still passes. Pipeline/TaskGraph/current_conformance.py binds the entire GDD hash and manually listed surfaces, while conformance_records.py permits empty evidence lists/surfaces. AgentRuntime providers reject writes and approved commands, and TaskExecution is only an audit wrapper. Since the historical camera GER commit, 244 commits landed with no runtime-script changes. Conversely, the camera and destructive-test incidents directly support preserving runtime feedback, bounded repair, clean-tree Unity execution, and human qualitative review. Read-only diagnostics were actually executed with exit code 0; HEAD/tree remained 9f2485d/eea3cc6 and clean before and after. No Unity command was executed, so Unity version, XML, and assertion totals are not claimed.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/synthesis.json:42:      \"Delete empty-evidence acceptance and the requirement that both adapters precede one writable implementation lane.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/synthesis.json:107:        \"Implement PlayerMana.Reset, a distinct insufficient-mana signal that does not alter mana or report a successful spend, and a bounded PlayerManaUI response using the existing wired indicator. Preserve current spend/regeneration behavior and avoid scene saving/regeneration.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/synthesis.json:114:      \"success_test\": \"From a clean base, deliberately interrupt once after a checkpoint and resume without duplicate commits or lost state. The focused Unity run must keep all five existing PlayerManaPlayModeTests passing and add passing tests equivalent to Reset_RestoresFullMana_AndIsIdempotent, Spend_WhenInsufficient_RaisesDeniedExactlyOnce_WithoutChangingManaOrManaSpent, and PlayerManaUI_DeniedSpend_ShowsFeedback_ThenRestoresBaseline. Unity must exit 0, parsed XML must report zero failed tests, and Git HEAD/tree/status must be unchanged by testing. In Play Mode, the human repeatedly uses the existing debug spend control until a spend is denied and confirms the response is noticeable, bounded, and does not falsely reduce mana; reset behavior is also approved. After manual merge, rerun on the exact integration commit and publish the receipt. The workflow creates value only if this completes within one working day, with no more than two repairs, roughly 90 minutes or less of human hands-on orchestration, and no generalized platform subsystem added.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/reviews/workflow_systems_architect.json:94:        \"observation\": \"NSC-023 currently derives as conformant from committed evidence. The human approval is represented only by a nonempty name and prose inside a repository JSON record, not an independently authenticated approval receipt.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/reviews/game_producer.json:186:      \"The Unity lane is a human-invoked Windows PowerShell wrapper, not an integrated execution/recovery service; Windows build settings are still empty.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/reviews/adversarial_qa.json:58:        \"observation\": \"Record validation permits an empty conformance-surface list and permits a passing gate with an empty evidence list; such a manually authored receipt can become structurally valid without executable proof.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/reviews/adversarial_qa.json:62:        \"observation\": \"The synthetic suite tests a missing gate and corrupt artifact, but not empty gate evidence, empty surfaces, or semantic contract-to-canon coverage after a GDD revision.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/reviews/adversarial_qa.json:134:      \"Typed completion gates defining required runner, artifact type, human check, and whether evidence may ever be empty.\",\nPipeline/ArchitectureReview/outputs/codex/runs/20260823T102213Z-35a76864/reviews/adversarial_qa.json:145:        \"Revise NSC-005 to contract revision 2: remove duplicate readability gates, remove stale scene evidence, and define typed proof for reset behavior, denied-spend signaling, actual UI feedback, and human readability.\",\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
